; Description
: This is one of a set of templates used to mark the use of an image under the Creative Commons license.
* {{t|Cc-by-4.0}} - Attribution
* {{t|Cc-by-sa-4.0}} - Attribution-ShareAlike
* {{t|Cc-by-nc-4.0}} - Attribution-NonCommercial
* {{t|Cc-by-nc-sa-4.0}} - Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike

; Syntax
: Type <code><nowiki>{{Cc-by-4.0}}</nowiki></code> (or other equivalent template) on the image information page.

: You may add a parameter to specify the source of attribution.

